WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: The Fortress
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.500
[Instrumental Intro — Heavy Warehouse Guitar Riff & Driving Drums]

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.500
The world was burning, the lies were loud

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.500
We were the joke in the tabloid crowd

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:44.000
We had no shelter, we had no home

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.500
Just the open road, and a telephone

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.200
But you, you built a fortress!

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.000
You gave us walls when we were torn

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.800
You built a place to hide from the storm

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.200
You are the "Ironheads"! You are the shield!

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:16.800
The only army that would not yield!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:22.000
This is our fortress!

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:28.800
This isn't L.A., this isn't a dream

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:35.200
This is a warehouse, this is a scream

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:41.800
We're building our truth, we're building our sound

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:48.500
Right here on our hallowed ground

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.800
'Cause you, you built a fortress!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:59.500
You gave us walls when we were torn

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:03.500
You built a place to hide from the storm

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:08.600
You are the "Ironheads"! You are the shield!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:15.800
The only army that would not yield!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:21.500
This is our fortress!

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:51.500
[Guitar Solo — Soaring Heavy Warehouse Lead Guitar Solo]

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:59.300
Our fortress... our home...

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:09.000
We are the Forgers!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:19.900
[Outro — Heavy Guitar & Drum Finale]
